### Grupo no visible → 400 "No tiene acceso al grupo"
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getMonitor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-11-23T06:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-24T05:59:59",
  "groupId": 1
}

### Rango mayor a 92 días → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getMonitor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T06:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-06-01T05:59:59"
}

### Agente sin JB020 → 400 "No tiene permiso para ver el monitor de jobs"
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getMonitor
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAgent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-11-23T06:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-24T05:59:59"
}
